TITLE CO2 equilibrium activity of H+
SOLUTION 1 Pure water
    temp      25
    pH        7.0     charge
    units     mol/kgw
EQUILIBRIUM_PHASES 1
    CO2(g)   -3.4   10
SELECTED_OUTPUT
    -reset   false
    -high_precision true
    -solution true
    -pH      true
    -totals   H(0) H(1)
USER_PUNCH
    -start
    10 PUNCH ACT("H+")
    -end
END
